{
  "html": "\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; padding: 0 0 24px; background-color: #f8f9fb; color: #1f2937; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; overflow-wrap: anywhere\" data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-imported\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"padding: 10px 18px; background-color: #14325c; border-bottom: 3px solid #c29b52; display: table; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: table-cell; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #f5d694\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003eRESEARCH BRIEF\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: table-cell; text-align: right; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: #cbd5e1\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003eDATA DESK\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"padding: 16px 18px 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; padding: 13px 15px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #d7dfe9; border-top: 3px solid #c29b52\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: #9c7834; margin-bottom: 5px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003eKEY TAKEAWAY\u003c/span\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #273447; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 14.5px; letter-spacing: 0.4px; line-height: 1.88; margin: 0\"\u003e面对宏观周期与行业财报拆解，机构级深藏青顶栏与金铜细线在打开瞬间建立专业信任感。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 24px 0 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 2px solid #14325c; display: table; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display: table-cell; width: 36px; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #b88e44; font-family: Menlo, Consolas, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, monospace\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e01\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: table-cell; width: 14px; vertical-align: middle; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 16px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e|\u003c/span\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #14325c\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e核心指标与阶段对比一览\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 16px 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; color: #1f2937; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cthead\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth style=\"background-color: #14325c; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; color: #f8fafc; font-weight: 700; padding: 8px 10px; text-align: left\"\u003e指标维度\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth style=\"background-color: #14325c; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; color: #f8fafc; font-weight: 700; padding: 8px 10px; text-align: left\"\u003e关键表现\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/thead\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; color: #1f2937; padding: 8px 10px\"\u003e毛利率变化\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; color: #1f2937; padding: 8px 10px\"\u003e+4.2 pct（高毛利产品占比提升）\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; color: #1f2937; padding: 8px 10px\"\u003e经营现金流\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; color: #1f2937; padding: 8px 10px\"\u003e连续 6 季度保持正向净流入\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; color: #1f2937; padding: 8px 10px\"\u003e研发投入比\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; color: #1f2937; padding: 8px 10px\"\u003e14.8%（聚焦核心平台底座）\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 18px 0; padding: 13px 16px; background-color: #f1f5f9; border-left: 4px solid #14325c\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"border: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #14325c; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.4px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 0\"\u003e数据本身不会说话，但严谨的框架能让趋势自己浮出水面。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 24px 0 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 2px solid #14325c; display: table; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display: table-cell; width: 36px; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #b88e44; font-family: Menlo, Consolas, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, monospace\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e02\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: table-cell; width: 14px; vertical-align: middle; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 16px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e|\u003c/span\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #14325c\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e商业长文的机构化编排\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #1f2937; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.4px; line-height: 1.88; margin: 0 0 15px\"\u003e深藏青反白表头与 KEY TAKEAWAY 金线摘要框兼顾速览效率与研报质感，适合财经观察与商业复盘。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 18px 0; padding: 6px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #d5dde7\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/minimal-architecture.jpg\" alt=\"现代金融建筑结构与干净光线\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 24px 0 0; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid #cbd5e1\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #64748b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.4px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0\"\u003e以上数据仅作行业观察示例，欢迎在评论区探讨周期变化。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
